  "steps": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a medium saucepan over a medium heat. Add the garlic, ginger and chilli and cook for 1 minute, stirring, until fragrant but not browned.",
    "Pour in the vegetable stock and bring to a gentle boil. Simmer for 8 minutes so the ginger and chilli flavour the broth.",
    "Add the mushrooms and tomato wedges. Simmer for 5 minutes, until the mushrooms are tender and the tomatoes have softened but still hold their shape.",
    "Stir in the prawns and cook for 2–3 minutes, until they turn pink, curl slightly and are opaque all the way through.",
    "Turn the heat to low. Stir in the fish sauce, soy sauce, sugar and lime juice. Taste and adjust with a pinch of salt and black pepper if needed; the soup should be hot, sour and savoury.",
    "Ladle into bowls and finish with sliced spring onions and chopped coriander. Serve immediately while the prawns are tender and the broth is steaming hot."
